# Resolved guest module classpaths are build output, not source. `*.jar` is already
# ignored repo-wide (.gitignore:35); these are explicit so an empty-handed clone is
# obviously incomplete rather than subtly wrong.
build/
*/lib/
*/classes/

# MANIFEST.tsv is NOT ignored on purpose: it is the reproducibility record (coordinates,
# sizes, sha256) that makes a mounted classpath checkable with GuestModules.verify().
!*/MANIFEST.tsv
